 - Hides cancelled and completed appointments. Appointments with no status are shown.
 - Appointments with no `start_time` stay listed for their whole day, after the timed ones, and show "Time TBD".
 - Sorted by date, then time. Shows up to 10.
+
+## Training Progress Checklist
+
+The checklist on a student's profile reads existing tables and writes only to `student_progress`.
+
+### course_topics
+
+| Column | Used for |
+| --- | --- |
+| topic_id | Checklist item key |
+| topic | Topic heading (rows with the same topic are grouped) |
+| subtopic | Checklist item |
+| display_order | Order on the page |
+| course_id | Only rows matching the student's `course_id` are shown |
+
+### student_progress
+
+| Column | Used for |
+| --- | --- |
+| student_id | Student (`students.id`) |
+| course_topic_id | Checklist item (`course_topics.topic_id`) |
+| is_completed | `true` when checked, `false` when unchecked |
+| completed_at | When it was checked (empty when unchecked) |
+
+Checking a box creates the student's record for that item, or edits it if it exists. Unchecking edits the same record to `is_completed = false`. No unique constraint is required.
+
+### Page
+
+| Method | Path | Page |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| GET | `/students/trainingprogress?id=` | Checklist for one student (linked from the student profile) |
+| GET | `/students/student-progress?id=` | Second view of the same checklist, with a mark-all box per topic (also linked from the profile) |
+| POST | `/students/trainingprogress` or `/students/student-progress` | Saves one or several checkbox changes |
+
+Saving needs `AVIATE_LOCAL_WRITES=1` on this computer, or `AVIATE_DEMO_WRITES=1` to allow any computer during a showcase. The app has no login yet, so set `AVIATE_DEMO_WRITES` back to `0` afterwards.
